Short:        Python 3.14 for UP-Term
Author:       spotUP
Uploader:     UPLOADER-ADDRESS-PLACEHOLDER (spotUP)
Type:         dev/lang
Version:      @VERSION@
Replaces:     none
Architecture: m68k-amigaos >= 3.0.0; m68k-020
Requires:     comm/term/UP-Term.lha >= @NEEDSBASE@ (it brings the patched ixemul.library)
Distribution: Aminet

Python 3.14 for an UP-Term window (the patched ixemul.library of the base archive).

Needs the base archive UP-Term.lha (version @NEEDSBASE@ or newer) installed first. About
15 MB installed.

Install: unpack, double-click Install. Uninstall removes the Python3: assign and its files.

